OL,3,AGreens would offer two-year jobs to
OL,4,Aunemployed under-24s
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Greens have not specified a budget
OL,7,Ffor the policy, but have argued it
OL,8,Fwould reduce spending on welfare and
OL,9,Fboost tax receipts from employment.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
